d in in space  and would this be the book that I should  read so I can talk to this brilliant  child well yes you could read this book  to talk to him and you can also by don't  know much about the solar system which  is a picture book for five-year-olds see  we're covering all the demographic bases  now marketing marketing marketing no  I've actually just begun writing books  for children this is sort of a lifelong  dream when my own children were growing  up I didn't think there was there were  wonderful picture books and wonderful  storybooks but I didn't think there was  enough good nonfiction for children so  I've brought that don't know much about  idea having fun jokes riddles questions  and brought them down for for children  but certainly you could read this book  and he could read that book and then you  could have a really interesting  conversation together so thank you very  much and thank you all for coming I  appreciate very much I need to mention  before we all leave that Kenneth will be  signing and the signing colonnade which  is on legislative Plaza  we're walking over there right now if  you want to go Thanks
 

